<title>USA: ADM says Michael Andreas on leave.</title>
<headline>ADM says Michael Andreas on leave.</headline>
<dateline>DECATUR, Ill. 1996-10-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Archer Daniels Midland Co said vice chairman Michael Andreas has received company approval to take temporary administrative leave and group vice president Terrance Wilson announced his recent retirement from the company due to medical reasons.</p>
</text>
